<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n72623" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰο-πόλος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶος, πέλομαι</span>) of places, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lonely,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρεα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					11.574
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χῶρος, σταθμός,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				13.473
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				19.377
			</span></i> ; of persons, <i>solitary, unaccompanied,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαίμων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					4.28
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶς, -πόλος,</span> cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰπόλος</span>) <i>tending sheep,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄρτεμις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Dith.</u>
					2.19
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἑρμῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Merc.</u>
					314
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀπόλλων</span>
			v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Coluth.
				309
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεαί,</span> of the Hesperides,
				<i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.1322
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1413
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πάριν οἰοπόλοισιν ἐφεδριόωντα θοώκοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Coluth.
					15
				</span></i>
			. (Signf. <i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i> is alternatively derived from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶς,
				πολέω</span> (as if 'sheep-traversed') in Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				13.473
			</span></i>.)</div>
